        <mxCell id="seq49" value="No separate job state: &amp;quot;done&amp;quot; = all configured publisher files exist + manifest entry.&lt;br&gt;Empty publisher-hour still gets a zero-row file, or FindWork would pick that hour up forever.&lt;br&gt;State-machine timeout 25 min, so a stuck run can&amp;#x27;t hold the lock past the next trigger.&lt;br&gt;FindWork checks only the Parquet bucket, so a failed Writer B hour is not retried (known gap)." style="shape=note;size=10;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;fillColor=#FFFBE6;strokeColor=#C9A227;fontSize=11.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;fontColor=#232F3E;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="300.0" y="2096.0" width="1020.0" height="74.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
